      <p begin="02:04.660" end="02:07.960" ttm:agent="v1">휘저어 휘저어 휘저어 휘저어</p>
      <p begin="02:07.960" end="02:11.230" ttm:agent="v1">마음을 담아서 휘저어 휘저어</p>
      <p begin="02:11.230" end="02:14.890" ttm:agent="v1">휘저어 휘저어 힘차고 조심히</p>
      <p begin="02:14.890" end="02:18.440" ttm:agent="v1">휘저어 휘저어 바나나 쉐이크</p>
      <p begin="02:18.440" end="02:25.060" ttm:agent="v1">La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la</p>
      <p begin="02:25.060" end="02:31.650" ttm:agent="v1">La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la</p>
      <p begin="02:31.650" end="02:38.380" ttm:agent="v1">그 녀석이 또 바나나를 까는군</p>
      <p begin="02:38.380" end="02:45.340" ttm:agent="v1">세 개를 까다니 원숭이보다 더하네</p>
      <p begin="02:45.340" end="02:49.230" ttm:agent="v1">그래도 귀엽기만 하면</p>
      <p begin="02:49.230" end="02:51.740" ttm:agent="v1">귀여운 바나나-나-나</p>
      <p begin="02:51.740" end="02:54.710" ttm:agent="v1">우유가 가득한 한 컵</p>
